From 1761a7e331c909536c935fc5947841d7a996c35c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ariel D'Alessandro <ariel.dalessandro@collabora.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Jul 2025 12:36:19 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "[rust] Broader dependency on
 `//build/rust/allocator`."

This reverts commit ecdd28a15dfd184c9190d36d2609a308677743f0.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Ariel D'Alessandro <ariel.dalessandro@collabora.com>
